    25 SEP 2025
    Updated init_part.f90 to read in tagp as real(sp) rather than int8, and recast it to int8 when assigning it to typep(:)%tag. The reason is that he initial condition files do not allow to write a tag of type int8 (int32 in python), but rather as real(sp) (or float32 in python).
    TESTED with hbd_26_hyb (which initially was identical to hbd_26).

